{"description": "Pixel art TV home shopping broadcast frame, a 2000s CRT TV shot, 4:3. MAIN SUBJECT, LARGE: the show host fills the left half of the frame, his body from the top of his head to his hands on the podium spans two thirds of the image height. Realistic adult proportions: small head, broad shoulders, long torso, not chibi, not cartoon. Black suit, white shirt, dark red tie, combed black hair, unnaturally white made-up face, eyes completely black with no whites, thin closed-lip smile, no teeth, no headset. He stands behind a glossy red podium with a chrome edge, both hands on its top, facing the camera. Camera slightly above eye level, one-point perspective, a raised stage, side set panels angled inward. Packed set, no empty wall: a marquee bulb arch above him; far left a tall chat monitor and gift boxes; six separate spotlights on a truss; two cue light boxes with clap and smile icons; a red-digit sales board; a large studio screen with a plain bar graphic and no text, framed by marquee bulbs; a red Korean street mailbox with an upside-down dried-blood cross; a demo table with a white cloth and a low round striped turntable, its top empty; square glowing light tiles along the stage front; red and black lacquer panels with gold trim. LIGHT: key light on his face, pink and cyan rim light, deep black shadows, glossy floor reflections. Dense, highly detailed pixel art, crisp pixel clusters, no dithering, no blur. No letters, no words, no other people.", "image_size": {"width": 592, "height": 444}, "no_background": false, "reference_images": [{"image": {"type": "base64", "base64": "", "format": "png"}, "size": {"width": 592, "height": 444}, "usage_description": "LAYOUT, SIZE AND DEPTH: copy where things are, how big they are and the perspective from this line drawing. Above all keep the host this big, with these body proportions: head to hands on the left. Also the bulb rows, spotlights, cue lights, chat monitor, sales board, bulb-framed screen, table with turntable, mailbox, stage front tiles, vanishing point and floor lines. Do not copy the white or the lines."}, {"image": {"type": "base64", "base64": "", "format": "png"}, "size": {"width": 390, "height": 105}, "usage_description": "PIXEL SCALE: these product icons will be placed on the turntable at exactly this pixel size. Match their pixel density, outline thickness and shading. Do not draw these objects."}]}